Server init.
>> a := Blob hou: 4.
a bytes: ( Rārangi hou ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob hou: 4.
b bytes: ( Rārangi hou ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a hou.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Huaputa tuhi: ['xorred:'], rārangi-hou. 
Huaputa tuhi: n, rārangi-hou. 
} hopu: { :e Huaputa tuhi: e, rārangi-hou. }, tīmata.
a wewete.
b wewete.
